  "prefLabel": "Geo 307.02 Pocket Cards",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Geo 307.02 Pocket Cards. Biennially, the board shall issue a pocket card upon receipt of the biennial renewal form and fee. The card shall certify that the geologist holds a license in good standing and is authorized to practice geology to the date of expiration as shown on the card.\n\nSource. #7526, eff 7-1-01; ss by #9439, eff 3-25-09; ss by #12152, eff 3-24-17",
